bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">${empty mid}          &lt;!-- null 또는 &quot;&quot; 또는 빈 컬렉션이면 true --&gt;\r\n${not empty vos}\r\n\r\n${A &gt; B}    ${A gt B}      &lt;!-- 초과 --&gt;\r\n${A &lt; B}    ${A lt B}      &lt;!-- 미만 --&gt;\r\n${A &gt;= B}   ${A ge B}      &lt;!-- 이상 --&gt;\r\n${A &lt;= B}   ${A le B}      &lt;!-- 이하 --&gt;\r\n${A == B}   ${A eq B}      ${A != B}   ${A ne B}\r\n${a &amp;&amp; b}   ${a and b}     ${a || b}   ${a or b}\r\n${point &gt;= 60 ? &#x27;합격&#x27; : &#x27;불합격&#x27;}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">숫자 비교 주의</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">${A &gt; B}                                          &lt;!-- 둘 다 문자열이면 글자 비교 (&quot;10&quot; &lt; &quot;9&quot;) --&gt;\r\n${Integer.valueOf(A) &gt; Integer.valueOf(B)}        &lt;!-- 숫자로 변환 후 비교 --&gt;\r\n${A + 0 &gt;= B + 0}                                 &lt;!-- + 0 으로 숫자 변환 --&gt;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › null 처리, JavaScript › 형 변환 (== vs ===)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/el/operator","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"el","title":"EL 표현식","path":